		(uuid "7d025ca1-b4ad-40c2-9d70-de9da8d03311")
	)
	(text "Theoretical inrush current:\n- up to 100A * 20us (due to ceramics)\n- up to 45A * 200us (bulk capacitance)\n\nFuse won't trigger: it needs ca 50A * 1ms to trip"
